      "writtenOn": "2021-09-02T20:23:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would like to keep it. It means \u0027markForBinder\u0027 as in \u0027mark this Parcel as being built for a specific IBinder\u0027. \u0027binder\u0027 is an overloaded term. Sure, it means the kernel binder protocol, but it also represent userspace libbinder/etc concepts whether or not they are now backed by RPC calls. Hopefully the documentation update here is enough? please re-open if not.",
      "parentUuid": "14791171_28f9dddb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 521,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 521,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "92ab137b56b59fa582032dfdf956d85dde9b02df",
