        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-03T18:58:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. Though, A isn\u0027t true currently, and C is an implementation detail of another system. I\u0027ve added B/D and some related points.\n\n\u003e I wish we could enforce (B) for the clients targeting T or beyond.\n\nThe downside isn\u0027t so much. If someone wants to use RPC, they should be using AIDL anyway.\n\n\u003e I also see that there is no way to cut the association.\n\nDon\u0027t call the function in the first place :)",
      "parentUuid": "5ee6b2b9_53d4dc2f",
